DuoLinux — dual-screen Debian on the Retroid Pocket Duo

  top screen     fleet / LLM / local cockpit
  bottom screen  launcher + terminals
  start          launcher        select  on-screen keyboard
  L1 / R1        switch screens  Y       refresh

First things to do:
  1. passwd                     change the default password
  2. nano /etc/duo/duo.conf     add your server(s)
  3. duo-keys                   copy the device key to your server
  4. duo-tailscale login        join your tailnet (or put an auth key in
                                /etc/duo/tailscale.authkey before boot)

Logs:      ~/.local/state/duo/session.log
           /var/log/duo-firstboot.log
Recovery:  Ctrl-Alt-F2 for a console on any USB keyboard
